  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v1.0.8 - Pages Directory Support (January 2026)\n- NEW: SetPagesDirectory() - Configure separate directory for page templates\n- NEW: RenderPage() - Render page templates directly\n- NEW: RenderFile(path, isPage) - Flag to choose between components/pages directory\n- Auto .html extension - No need to specify file extension\n\nv1.0.7 - Type-Specific Component Tags\n- Type-Specific Tags - Element, Block, Data, Nav with auto path prefix\n- OnAfterIncludeRender callback - fires after component renders for wrapping\n- ComponentType property in IncludeInfo - identify component type\n\nv1.0.6 - OnBeforeIncludeRender Event\n- OnBeforeIncludeRender callback - fires before each Include renders\n- Param default attribute + Folder-based components\n\nv1.0.5 - Pre-Render Data Extraction\nv1.0.4 - Auto Cache Invalidation\nv1.0.0 - Initial Release",
